  "title": "Granny&#39;s Sweet Potato Bread",
  "description": "This old-fashioned sweet potato quick bread recipe with brown sugar, plus cinnamon and nutmeg, also includes chopped pecans in the batter and on top.",
  "authors": [
    "Jessica Shelton"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:51:28-04:00",
